    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Masengo ga ŵakutaga mbopesi ni Alefi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵatite kwa Aloni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " “M'mwejo, ni Alefi mkuŵajilwa kulaga ligongo lya ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " uliwose wakwayana ni pakutumicila mu tenti jakusimanilana, nambo m'mwejo ni ŵanace ŵenu timcilaga ligongo lya kupanganya masengo ga ŵakutaga mbopesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myice nawo acalongo acimjenu, ŵa lukosyo lwa Lefi, kuti apanganyeje pamo ni m'mwejo masengo ni kumkamucisya pakupanganya masengo ku tenti m'mwejo ni ŵanace ŵenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akusosekwa kukwanilisya masengo gawo kwa m'mwejo ni ma udindo gawo ga ku tenti, nambo ngamkwenela kuyiŵandicila yindu yakusagulidwa ku Malo Geswela ni malo gakupelecela mbopesi. Naga akutenda, wosope ni m'mwejo ŵakwe tacimwulaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo tacipanganya masengo ni m'mwejo ni kukwanilisya ma udindo gawo ga masengo gosope mu tenti, nambo mundu jwangaŵajilwa akapanganya masengo ni wawojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'mwejo ni ŵanace ŵenu mkwenela kukwanilisya ma udindo gawo ga ku Malo Geswela ni malo gakupelecela mbopesi, myoyo ngasimbya soni mtima kwapila Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Une ni junamsagwile acalongo acimjenu Alefi pasikati pa Aisalaeli mpela mtuka kwa m'mwejo. Jemanjajo ali ŵakulipeleka kwa une, myoyo tacipakombola kutenda masengo gawo mu tenti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo m'mwejo ni timcikwanilisya ma udindo gosope ga ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵakusakwayana ni malo gakupelecela mbopesi ni yele yayili ku Cipinda Ceswela Mnope. Ayi yinduyi yiŵele udindo wawo, ligongo une napele wawojo mtuka wa ŵakutaga mbopesi. Mundu jwalijose jwangaŵajilwa jwakwika ni kuyiŵandicila yindu yakusagulidwa tacimwulaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mbuwa ja ŵakutaga mbopesi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵatite kwa Aloni, “Mkumbucile kuti une ngumpa m'mwejo yakupeleka yakusosekwa yakumbanganyicisya uneji yimkaniyiŵa mbopesi syakutinisya. Nguyipeleka kwa m'mwejo ni kwa yisukulu yenu mpela mbali ja m'mwejo mpaka kalakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mbopesi syakusagulidwa mnope syangatinisya pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi, ni asi syakumŵajila m'mwejo: mbopesi sya mbeju sya songolo, mbopesi sya ulemwa, ni mbopesi syakulipila magambo. Cilicose cakucipeleka kwa une mpela mbopesi jakusagulidwa jili ja m'mwejo ni ŵanace ŵenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'mwejo mlyeje yele yinduyi m'malo gakusagulidwa, nipo mlyeje acalumepe basi, myitendeje yakusagulidwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pakonjecesya, yakupeleka yambone yiliyose yakuyipeleka Aisalaeli kwa une tiyiciŵa ya wawojo. Une nguyipeleka kwa wawojo, ŵanace ŵawo, ni ŵacakongwe kwa ndaŵi syosope sya msogolo. Mundu jwalijose jwa mwiŵasa mwawo jwali jwamswejele mpela mwa misyungu akukomboleka kuyilya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Une ngwapa wawojo yakupunda kusalala yosope yandanda kugowola yakusapelekaga Aisalaeli kwa une caka cilicose: mawuta ga olifi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " finyo, ni yimanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosopeyo yili ya wawojo. Mundu jwalijose jwa mwiŵasa mwawo jwali jwamswejele mpela mwa misyungu akukomboleka kulya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Cilicose mu Isalaeli cacipelece kuŵa ca une cili ca wawojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.27.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lef 27:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanace jwalijose jwandanda kupagwa kapena cinyama cakucipeleka Aisalaeli kwa une cili ca wawojo. Nambo akuŵajilwa kumwombola mwanace jwandanda kupagwa jwalijose, nipo akuŵajilwa soni kuwombola cinyama cilicose candanda kupagwa cicili cangaswejela mpela mwa msyungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵanace ŵa msingu wakwana mwesi umo tacawombola pa mtengo wa mbiya sya masilifa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " msano, malinga ni mtengo wakwenela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵanace ŵandanda kupagwa ŵa ng'ombe, ngondolo, ni mbusi akasiŵawombola, ŵelewo ali ŵangune nipo ŵapelece ku mbopesi. Akusulileje miasi jakwe pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi ni kutinisya mawuta gakwe mpela mbopesi ja yakulya, jajikwete liwungo lyakusangalasya une. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyama jakwejo jiŵe ja m'mwejo, mpela cidali ni lukongolo lwa ku mlyo lwa kunyuma lwa mbopesi jambone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Une ngupeleka kwa m'mwejo, kwa ŵanace ŵenu ŵacalume, ni kwa ŵanace ŵenu ŵacakongwe kwa mpaka kalakala, yakusonjesya yosope yakusapelekaga kwa une Aisalaeli. Aci cili cilanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " cangapasuka cindesile ni m'mwejo pamo ni yisukulu yenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵatite kwa Aloni, “M'mwejo ngasimpocela katundu kapena cilambo cilicose mu Isalaeli kuŵa cenucenupe. Une ndili AMBUJE, nipo tinjimpa cilicose cicikumsoŵa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakupocela ya Alefi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
